{
  "conversations": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Got everything. Good thing we helped out that stall owner and that staff member earlier.",
        "zh": "东西都齐了，幸好帮了那位摊主还有那个工作人员。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 1,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Heave-ho. I’ll leave the extinguisher here. What do we even need all this stuff for?",
        "zh": "嘿咻。灭火器我放到这里了。我们要这些东西干什么啊？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 2,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "I just ran into a local puppet-maker around here. The thread he uses for his puppets is very similar to the one I saw on the plane.",
        "zh": "刚才我在周边遇到了一位本地木偶匠人，他用来制作木偶的丝线和我之前在飞机上看到的非常类似。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 3,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "The material is like spider silk: it melts when heated, and becomes brittle when exposed to cold.",
        "zh": "这种丝线材质类似蛛丝，遇热会融化，遇冷会脆化。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 4,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_惊讶",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Right, the people had those threads implanted in their bodies!",
        "zh": "对了，那些人身体里被植入了丝线！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 5,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Exactly. We can’t start a fire inside a plane, but we can lower the temperature in a way that doesn’t threaten the plane’s safety.",
        "zh": "是的，我们不能在飞机里放火，但却可以在不威胁飞机安全的情况下降温。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 6,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "The lantern stall uses paper and is close to a heat source, so it’s considered a high fire-risk stall type.",
        "zh": "花灯摊位有纸制品且靠近热源，属于易引发火灾的摊位类型。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 36,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_惊讶",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Ah! So if we spray the controlled people on the plane with this—",
        "zh": "啊！只要我们拿这个喷飞机上被控制的人——",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 8,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "Yes. My guess is it should temporarily disable their ability to move.",
        "zh": "是的，我推测应该可以令他们暂时失去行动能力！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 9,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_大笑",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Haha! You’re amazing! Master was totally right about you!",
        "zh": "哈哈！你真是太厉害了！师父果然是对的！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 10,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_惊讶",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "Uh, so… what’s the speaker for?",
        "zh": "欸，那这个音响是做什么的？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 11,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "这只是我的一个猜想。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 12,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_惊讶",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "什么意思？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 13,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "刚才探索时，我找到了极乐戏团设立在会场的一个摊位。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 14,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "一位工作人员告诉我，戏团的成员希望在摊位附近的音响循环播放一种鼓点。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 15,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_惊讶",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "鼓点？说起来，我之前在飞机上就一直能听到一种很轻很低的响声来着......",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 16,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "嗯，刚才我修好音响后听了一下，摊位和飞机上播放的确实是同一种鼓点。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 17,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "自然界中，大多数结网蜘蛛通常视力不佳，它们靠震动来感受猎物在蛛网上的位置和状态。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 18,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_惊讶",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "这和那个鼓点有什么关系呢？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 19,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "你之前提到过，被控制的人是被植入了丝线。也就是说戏团的偶师并不是从外部控制的它们，而是使用某种方法直接调动了人们体内的丝线。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 20,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "鼓点应该不是偶师用来主导人偶行动的控制器，因为它是固定的背景声，在我几次循环的记忆中也都没有改变。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 21,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "但戏团的需求，说明鼓声对于控制过程也是必要的。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 22,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "我猜想那种鼓点或许充当了一种调频媒介。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 23,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_惊讶",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "调频？那又是什么意思？",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 24,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_思考",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "还记得我之前说蜘蛛是靠震动感受蛛网情况的吗？我认为飞机上的过程是相反的。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 25,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "鼓点就像是一段持续的震动一样，让被控制的人们，维持成了“蛛网”的联合受控状态。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 26,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "我感觉我的脑子要爆炸了......",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 27,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_闭眼",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "抱歉，都没关系的。这些归根结底也都是猜想。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 28,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "但无论如何，维持鼓点的节奏都是戏团所需要的。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 29,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "name": {
        "en": "Veris",
        "zh": "何以真",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/何以真_日常",
      "isPlayer": true,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "而我们只需要破坏掉它就好了，或许一点摇滚乐就能搞定。",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 30,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_大笑",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "好！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 31,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "name": {
        "en": "Page",
        "zh": "周书",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "avatarAddr": "DialogueImages/周书_日常",
      "isPlayer": false,
      "content": {
        "en": "",
        "zh": "那我们准备用明镜回到飞机上吧！",
        "ja": ""
      },
      "nextIndex": 32,
      "choices": [],
      "eventCalls": []
    },
    {
